Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.92,0:00:03.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,But first, our Gujarati film.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.09,0:00:06.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,In theatres from today: King of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.38,0:00:07.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,Salangpur,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.12,0:00:09.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,a Gujarati film on Hanuman Dada.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.97,0:00:12.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the face-off? Ayushmann's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.18,0:00:13.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeh Prem Mol Liya
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.48,0:00:15.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,versus Emraan's Gunmaaster G9!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.25,0:00:17.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Watching from home?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.51,0:00:19.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,Drishyam: The Conclusion is on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.49,0:00:20.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Netflix from today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.23,0:00:23.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,Campus politics in Dhai Chaal on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.64,0:00:24.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,JioHotstar,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.47,0:00:26.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,and Hanuman Ansh on SonyLIV.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.06,0:00:28.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Screenshot this list,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.35,0:00:30.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,and send it to the family group.
